<section class="kube-start-section" aria-labelledby="community-contribution-title">
  <div class="kube-section-container">
    <div class="kube-home-section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="kube-label">Built for the Global Community</p>
        <h2 id="community-contribution-title">What KubeDaily has contributed to cloud native.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>We believe world-class Kubernetes education should be completely accessible. No paywalls, no vendor bias, and no superficial "hello world" demos.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kube-pillar-grid">
      <article class="kube-pillar-card">
        <div class="kube-pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">📊</div>
        <span class="kube-learning-step">Visual-First Learning</span>
        <h3>Interactive Pele &amp; SVG Diagrams</h3>
        <p>Complex distributed systems shouldn't be black boxes. We turn etcd quorums, eBPF kernel hooks, CNI packet traversal, and Operator reconcile loops into responsive, interactive visual mental models.</p>
        <a class="kube-learning-action" href="/labs/Learn-k8s">Explore visual architecture →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="kube-pillar-card">
        <div class="kube-pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">🛡️</div>
        <span class="kube-learning-step">Production Rigor</span>
        <h3>Zero-Paywall Master Labs</h3>
        <p>24 battle-tested master labs covering the full CKA, CKAD, and CKS curriculum, Linux container namespaces, Kyverno policies, Argo CD GitOps, Karpenter autoscaling, and building memory-safe operators in Rust with kube-rs.</p>
        <a class="kube-learning-action" href="/labs">Browse all 24 labs →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="kube-pillar-card">
        <div class="kube-pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧭</div>
        <span class="kube-learning-step">Open Ecosystem</span>
        <h3>340+ Curated Tool Directory</h3>
        <p>The definitive open-source index of cloud-native projects across 27 domains—from eBPF networking and AI model inference to cost optimization and cluster triage—complete with live GitHub star telemetry.</p>
        <a class="kube-learning-action" href="/tools">Search the tool stack →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="kube-pillar-card">
        <div class="kube-pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔬</div>
        <span class="kube-learning-step">Field-Tested Recipes</span>
        <h3>54 Architectural Tool Guides</h3>
        <p>Comprehensive, deep-dive technical articles breaking down real-world gotchas, production YAML manifests, benchmark comparisons, and disaster recovery procedures tested against real clusters.</p>
        <a class="kube-learning-action" href="/blog">Read field guides →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 lg:py-16 bg-white dark:bg-brand-gray-850" aria-labelledby="learning-tracks-title">
  <div class="kube-section-container">
    <div class="kube-home-section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="kube-label">End-to-End Curriculum</p>
        <h2 id="learning-tracks-title">Master the 8 cloud-native engineering tracks.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Follow structured, hands-on tracks designed to take you from foundational container mechanics to enterprise platform engineering.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kube-tracks-grid">
      <a class="kube-track-card" href="/labs/Learn-CKS-Security">
        <div class="kube-track-header">
          <span class="kube-track-badge">Track 01</span>
          <span class="kube-track-icon">🛡️</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Security &amp; Hardening (CKS)</h3>
        <p>Kernel auditing, Falco eBPF runtime threat detection, AppArmor, gVisor sandboxing, and ImagePolicyWebhooks.</p>
        <span class="kube-learning-action">Open CKS lab →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="kube-track-card" href="/labs/Learn-Kube-rs-CRD">
        <div class="kube-track-header">
          <span class="kube-track-badge">Track 02</span>
          <span class="kube-track-icon">🦀</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Rust Operators &amp; kube-rs</h3>
        <p>Build lightning-fast, 15MB RSS Kubernetes operators with CustomResource derive macros, async reconcilers, and finalizers.</p>
        <span class="kube-learning-action">Open Rust lab →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="kube-track-card" href="/labs/Learn-K8s-Networking">
        <div class="kube-track-header">
          <span class="kube-track-badge">Track 03</span>
          <span class="kube-track-icon">🌐</span>
        </div>
        <h3>eBPF Networking &amp; CNI</h3>
        <p>Cilium kernel packet routing, iptables bypass, Ingress controllers, CoreDNS ndots optimization, and EndpointSlices.</p>
        <span class="kube-learning-action">Open Networking lab →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="kube-track-card" href="/labs/Learn-Service-Mesh-Istio">
        <div class="kube-track-header">
          <span class="kube-track-badge">Track 04</span>
          <span class="kube-track-icon">🕸️</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Service Mesh &amp; Zero-Trust</h3>
        <p>Istio Envoy sidecar proxying, strict mutual TLS with SPIFFE IDs, Canary traffic splitting, and circuit breaking.</p>
        <span class="kube-learning-action">Open Istio lab →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="kube-track-card" href="/labs/Learn-GitOps-ArgoCD">
        <div class="kube-track-header">
          <span class="kube-track-badge">Track 05</span>
          <span class="kube-track-icon">🚀</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Declarative GitOps &amp; Delivery</h3>
        <p>Argo CD ApplicationSets, sync waves, automated drift correction, Flux CD Helm releases, and Tekton pipelines.</p>
        <span class="kube-learning-action">Open GitOps lab →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="kube-track-card" href="/labs/Learn-K8s-Observability">
        <div class="kube-track-header">
          <span class="kube-track-badge">Track 06</span>
          <span class="kube-track-icon">📈</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Observability &amp; Telemetry</h3>
        <p>Prometheus Operator, ServiceMonitors, PromQL alerting, OpenTelemetry Collector auto-instrumentation, and Grafana.</p>
        <span class="kube-learning-action">Open Observability lab →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="kube-track-card" href="/labs/Learn-K8s-Autoscaling">
        <div class="kube-track-header">
          <span class="kube-track-badge">Track 07</span>
          <span class="kube-track-icon">⚡</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Autoscaling &amp; FinOps</h3>
        <p>Karpenter just-in-time node provisioning, KEDA event-driven autoscaling with Kafka, and OpenCost cost allocation.</p>
        <span class="kube-learning-action">Open Autoscaling lab →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="kube-track-card" href="/labs/Learn-Linux-Containers">
        <div class="kube-track-header">
          <span class="kube-track-badge">Track 08</span>
          <span class="kube-track-icon">🐧</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Linux Containers from Scratch</h3>
        <p>Kernel isolation with unshare: Mount, PID, Net, User namespaces, Cgroups v2 memory limits, pivot_root, and rootless sandboxing.</p>
        <span class="kube-learning-action">Open Linux lab →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <form class="kube-home-search" action="/tools/" method="get" role="search" aria-label="Search the tool directory">
      <label for="home-tool-search">Search the 340+ Cloud-Native Tool Catalog</label>
      <div>
        <input id="home-tool-search" type="search" name="q" placeholder="Search GitOps, eBPF, AI, monitoring, storage, security…"/>
        <button class="kube-button" type="submit">Find tools →</button>
      </div>
      <p>A comprehensive directory with live GitHub star telemetry, category filters, and direct project links.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

